<http://data.silknow.org/object/f3f7a88d-e437-33fe-89a2-3306e24904fb/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Rectangular tan linen ground. Flowering and leafy naturalistic vines, a floral grouping tied with a ribbon, two small scenes with houses, one in a vine compartment, and, in a similar compartment, a wreath with the initials \"WT\" and the date. Motives oriented towards different edges of the ground. Slightly soiled and stained.  Stitches:  French knot, laid work, satin, stem."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f3f7a88d-e437-33fe-89a2-3306e24904fb> .

